wait 3500
tap SAVE
expect page 1
expect ap_browse_level 0
wait 200
shot regions-countries.png
turn SELECT 1
tap SEL
expect ap_browse_level 1
wait 200
shot regions-states.png
turn SELECT 1
tap SEL
expect ap_browse_level 2
wait 200
shot regions-confirm.png
tap PLAY
expect page 8
