wait 300
shot regions-player.png
tap OCT+
wait 200
expect ap_region >0
expect page 8
tap GLO
expect page 2
tap GLO
expect page 8
tap HOME
expect page 0
expect ap_region 0
wait 300
shot regions-world.png
